notes.body:
@AndersBroman This was done considering that we might add more Juniper proprietary IE's in the future. 
This will make the job easy while adding more Juniper properietary IE's.
Also in function dissect_v9_v10_template_fields() line 11754 there is a call to function val_to_str_ext() which is used to append the text to the field tree, here it will expect `v10_template_types_juniper_ext` as an entry in the table v10_template_type_vse_list[] or else it will print "Unknown(137)" instead of the expected string "OBSERVATION_DOMAIN_LEVEL_JUNIPER_COMMON_PROPERTIES".

